Hi Priya,

Thanks for the thorough review. Responses below:

1. Efficiency class: Go with IE3 for the motor. Our plant standard requires IE3 minimum per IS 12615.
2. Paint shade: RAL 7035 is fine.
3. Material: EN19 for the shaft is acceptable. Please ensure hardness is minimum 280 BHN.
4. Noise level: 75 dB is acceptable. Our site limit is 85 dB.

I'm adding Amit Shah (our purchase head) to this thread for the commercial discussion.

One more thing — we need a test certificate as per ISO 6336 for the gears and ASTM A388 for the shaft ultrasonic testing.

Need to check with our maintenance team if they need any special lubrication port positioning. Will confirm by Wednesday.

Final delivery should be within 6 weeks from drawing approval. Please confirm if this timeline works.

